# どうぶつの森 (Doubutsu no Mori, N64, NUS-NAFJ): its characters by code, a byte each, as the script reads them.
# Each was read in play: the codes of a page beside what the screen showed. Digits and signs are the ASCII codes,
# drawn full-width. Codes not met in play are not listed (the script gives U+FFFD for them).
